ve Vaccine Administered Within 4 Weeks")) request CPGCommunicationRequest with (activityTypeValue (backtickString `Should not vaccinate client for MCV0 as live vaccine was administered in the last 4 weeks. Check for any vaccines due, and inform the caregiver of when to come back for MCV0.`)) .)) (statement (activityStatement activity (activityIdentifier (identifier "Provide Measles Vaccine")) request CPGMedicationRequest with (terminologyReference (identifier "Measles vaccines")) .)) (statement (activityStatement activity (activityIdentifier (identifier "MCV0 Dose Administered")) request CPGCommunicationRequest with (activityTypeValue (backtickString `MCV0 was administered. Check measles routine immunization schedule.`)) .)) (statement (activityStatement activity (activityIdentifier (identifier "Client Age Less Than 12 Months")) request CPGCommunicationRequest with (activityTypeValue (backtickString `Should not vaccinate client as client's age is less than 12 months. Check for any vaccines due, and inform the caregiver of when to come back for MCV1.`)) .)) (statement (activityStatement activity (activityIdentifier (identifier "Last Live Vaccine Administered Within 4 Weeks_2")) request CPGCommunicationRequest with (activityTypeValue (backtickString `Should not vaccinate client for MCV1 as live vaccine was administered in the last 4 weeks. Check for any vaccines due and inform the caregiver of when to come back for MCV1.`)) .)) (statement (activityStatement activity (activityIdentifier (identifier "Client Age Less Than 15 Months")) request CPGCommunicationRequest with (activityTypeValue (backtickString `Should not vaccinate client for MCV2 as client's age is less than 15 months. Check for any vaccines due, and inform the caregiver of when to come back for MCV2.`)) .)) (statement (activityStatement activity (activityIdentifier (identifier "Last Live Vaccine Administered Within 4 Weeks_3")) request CPGCommunicationRequest with (activityTypeValue (backtickString `Should 